{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"closer\": \"X\",\n  \"x_off\": [],\n  \"y_off\": [\n    \"S03删去了想知道对方是否也有同样感受的念头，少了一层对亲密是否相互的在意，但偏离较轻。\",\n    \"S13把核心痛楚从“明知没人能保证永远，仍舍不得失去这份亲近”稍微转向“即使得到承诺，未来也未必一直美好”，使焦点偏向承诺能否保证未来的幸福。\",\n    \"S14加入“不后悔这样喜欢过”，把落点稍微带向对自己曾经付出的确认，而不是像X那样集中在仍然享受眼前亲近、却无法保证它能留住的甜与酸。\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"X更完整地把亲密带来的欢喜、害怕失去它而产生的痛、想收回心意以减少未来伤害却又舍不得收回的矛盾缠在一起。尤其S13至S14，痛楚始终来自幸福本身无法保证延续，而不是转成对承诺或未来生活质量的单独怀疑。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "3d75c0c2-fe3c-4842-bc46-0901e7572e97", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T093011998507Z", "elapsed_seconds": 23.547, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T09:30:35.566247+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "c3f9c0ccf4e5761b19baca51017be178886e1429e7230dcfac73c1e202d57327", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000